\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Unfrozen training trajectory: training-time validation FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) vs.\ epoch, over the full 5000-epoch run. FID is best at epoch\nobreakspace  {}2099 and degrades as R@1 rises; after epoch\nobreakspace  {}$\approx $3299, R@1 saturates in the 0.37--0.42 band while FID oscillates between 5.1 and 6.3. Dashed reference lines show EgoPed\xspace  's best operating point (FID=3.392, R@1=0.548 at epoch 3399, CFG 10). Unfrozen never approaches EgoPed\xspace  's performance on either metric.\relax }}{14}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h6_training}{{3}{14}{Unfrozen training trajectory: training-time validation FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) vs.\ epoch, over the full 5000-epoch run. FID is best at epoch~2099 and degrades as R@1 rises; after epoch~$\approx $3299, R@1 saturates in the 0.37--0.42 band while FID oscillates between 5.1 and 6.3. Dashed reference lines show \method 's best operating point (FID=3.392, R@1=0.548 at epoch 3399, CFG 10). Unfrozen never approaches \method 's performance on either metric.\relax }{figure.caption.14}{}}
